@startuml C4_Despliegue
title Diagrama de Despliegue C4 - Escenario 1A (Docker Compose)

node "PC Donada / Servidor Local" {
    node "Motor Docker Engine / Podman" {
        package "Red Virtual Docker (backend_net)" {
            node "Web App Container (Nginx / SPA)" as web
            node "API Backend Container (Monolito Modular)" as api
            node "Keycloak Container (OIDC)" as auth
            node "Mock Padron Container (Prism CLI)" as mock
            node "Swagger UI Container" as swagger
            database "SQLite DB (Volumen Persistente)" as db
        }
    }
}

web --> api : Consume API REST (HTTP / JSON)
web --> auth : Autentica usuario (OIDC / OAuth2)
api --> auth : Valida Token JWT (JWKS)
api --> db : Lee / Escribe transacciones (SQLite File I/O)
api --> mock : Consulta estado comedor (REST con ACL)
swagger ..> api : Lee contrato openapi.yaml
@enduml